{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>報章要聞｜東方：兩成港人憂回收飲品樽罐落堆填區／星島：當局採棚網新國標</strong></p><p>・東方聚焦飲品膠樽回收<br>・兩成港人憂膠樽堆填<br>・星島報道棚網新國標</p><p>暫時未能從TVB 新聞擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202107-報章要聞東方兩成港人憂回收飲品樽罐落堆填區星島當局採棚網新國標\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:01:44.668247+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:19.581122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:58:04.800970+00:00","content_hash":"aa3f209226954a64ccc8e88dc595da0ff7ed7a94e34c97b94458728174dbca49","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}